# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 82e17ca995bdbde20d2863f89f8c4519bce8f2e8a2602750ef543f5d5e72f2ca
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 66f5972d38a838a3ad91f4e589681270e46cd5347732adaa1f14a3476fb3ae80
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 3dfaa249ebd72fe479c49e1ad6f3dbdbc353b21114de2984236249b4677dabea
